# Flopsie, Bumi's Buddy {4}{G}{G}, 4/4: "When Flopsie enters, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control" and "Each creature you control
# with power 4 or greater can't be blocked by more than one creature" (CR 509.1b). Bot1 casts Hill Giant (3/3) on turn 1 and Grizzly Bears (2/2) on
# turn 3, and Flopsie on turn 5 (three Moxen and three Forests): Hill Giant becomes 4/4, exactly the limit, Bears 3/3, one short of it, Flopsie
# 5/5, and Bot2's two Ornithopters get nothing. Both attack; Bot2's Ornithopters may not both block the 4/4 Hill Giant (refusal) but may both block
# the 3/3 Bears, which takes no damage from them.

